B.acb=new A.jH("Privacy","PACT","Understand what you share.","A practical guide to account information, public profiles and deal activity in Pact. Review the visibility of information before publishing it or sharing it with other people.","",B.ajA,B.alc)
B.amF=s(["Decision tools","Professional discovery","Participant responsibility"],t.s)
B.acz=new A.d1("The role of Pact","Pact provides tools for organizing acquisition decisions and discovering professional support. Buyers, sellers and professionals remain responsible for their own decisions, information and agreements.",B.amF)
